  "title": "Savory Garlic Marinated Steaks",
  "description": "This New York strip or rib-eye marinade uses balsamic, soy sauce, garlic, honey, liquid smoke, and Worcestershire to add incredible flavor to steaks.",
  "authors": [
    "Angie Gorkoff"
  ],
